        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mwaka wa thanthatũ, mwei wa thanthatũ, mũthenya wa katano wa mwei, yĩla nekalĩte nyũmbanĩ yakwa, na atumĩa ma Yuta mekalĩte mbee wakwa, kw’oko kwa Mwĩaĩi Yeova kwambalũkĩla nĩ kw’o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
